## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
1. Run `npm run build` to ensure no TypeScript or CSS errors.
2. Verify `node_modules` includes Tailwind packages.

### Manual Verification
1. Run `npm run dev` and navigate to `/login` and `/register`.
2. Test the responsive design on mobile and desktop views.
3. Perform a test registration and login flow.
